   "width": 760,
   "height": 220,
   "text": "# The Tender For Law: architecture\n\nA static site built by Hugo from this repository and served by GitHub Pages, plus one running program, the Telegram bot.\n\nOpen any card to read its note. Start with [[README|the map]] or the overview card. Arrows show what feeds what. Move cards and add your own notes: this canvas is yours to annotate."
